{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, move to it, grab it, check it, move to destination, perform task or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
